WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.543
How many objects are in 1 equal groups of 1? Let us think carefully. Count 1 groups

00:00:05.543 --> 00:00:09.629
of 1: 1 times 1 equals 1. The answer is 1. Great work!

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:15.636
How many objects are in 2 equal groups of 2? Let us think carefully. Count 2 groups

00:00:15.636 --> 00:00:19.602
of 2: 2 times 2 equals 4. The answer is 4. Great work!

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:25.975
How many objects are in 3 equal groups of 3? Let us think carefully. Count 3 groups

00:00:25.975 --> 00:00:30.199
of 3: 3 times 3 equals 9. The answer is 9. Great work!

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:36.606
How many objects are in 4 equal groups of 4? Let us think carefully. Count 4 groups

00:00:36.606 --> 00:00:40.868
of 4: 4 times 4 equals 16. The answer is 16. Great work!
